{"lines":[{"h":0.011627906728013726,"y":0.088662790749365228,"x":0.067961165828965067,"c":1,"t":"SEB:","w":0.034951454798380535},{"c":1,"x":0.067961165853425265,"w":0.029126211802164709,"h":0.011627906728013615,"t":"LIA:","y":0.12209302333865102},{"w":0.036893202463785801,"h":0.011627906728013615,"y":0.15406976750162626,"t":"SEB:","c":1,"x":0.067961165747610894},{"h":0.010174419129748924,"c":1,"x":0.058252427745828589,"t":"LIA:","w":0.038834950129191081,"y":0.1860465113385833},{"w":0.034951454798380535,"y":0.20203488350720611,"t":"SEB:","x":0.067961165960033015,"h":0.01308139551465759,"c":1},{"w":0.027184467315673838,"y":0.21947674409962681,"c":1,"x":0.06990291187614367,"t":"LIA.","h":0.00872093034310506},{"h":0.012690457970925162,"c":1,"y":0.24940858029105495,"x":0.068949391247329267,"w":0.036845108668009441,"t":"SEB:"},{"c":1,"t":"LIA:","w":0.031904382705688475,"y":0.26648468551005089,"h":0.013524530238451682,"x":0.066678638600259951},{"w":0.036893202463785801,"h":0.013081395514657479,"c":1,"t":"SEB:","x":0.067961165976844956,"y":0.28197674393961891},{"w":0.027184464136759443,"y":0.29941860485562322,"t":"LIA:","x":0.069902913708319303,"h":0.010174417941369751,"c":1},{"h":0.01308139551465759,"x":0.069902913620227214,"t":"SEB:","y":0.32994186021868854,"w":0.034951454798380535,"c":1},{"h":0.011627906728013615,"t":"LIA:","y":0.34738372090924896,"w":0.029126211802164709,"x":0.069902913637752584,"c":1},{"t":"LIA:","x":0.069902913427396615,"h":0.011627906728013615,"c":1,"y":0.38662790705265992,"w":0.029126211802164723},{"t":"SEB.","x":0.071844660853236916,"y":0.42005813924053981,"c":1,"w":0.034951454798380535,"h":0.010174419129748813},{"x":0.071844661147461325,"y":0.48401162791506291,"w":0.029126211802164723,"h":0.011627906728013726,"t":"LIA:","c":1},{"x":0.071844660978063551,"t":"SEB:","y":0.50000000004130873,"w":0.034951454798380535,"h":0.011627906728013726,"c":1},{"x":0.073786407021774733,"t":"LIA.","y":0.51744186037869666,"h":0.00872093034310506,"c":1,"w":0.027184467315673824},{"x":0.073786408787881286,"y":0.56395348857655359,"w":0.033009707132975255,"c":1,"h":0.010174417941369751,"t":"SEB:"},{"w":0.029126211802164723,"x":0.071844661137752577,"t":"LIA:","y":0.59738372117708638,"h":0.010174417941369751,"c":1},{"x":0.071844661105664093,"w":0.034951454798380535,"y":0.61191860443743873,"t":"SEB:","h":0.013081395514657479,"c":1},{"t":"LIA:","x":0.071844661120583936,"y":0.67732558140343513,"h":0.011627906728013615,"c":1,"w":0.031067959467569989},{"y":0.72529069742799102,"t":"SEB:","w":0.034951454798380535,"h":0.013081395514657479,"c":1,"x":0.073786408765858263},{"w":0.052427183787027987,"h":0.010174417941369751,"c":1,"x":0.075728156294188248,"t":"TUTOR:","y":0.74127906992950887},{"y":0.081538656821298017,"c":1,"w":0.61784210205078116,"h":0.020543891692829996,"x":0.16485740235377894,"t":"Yes, I noticed that too. What about Jack? I noticed he seemed to want to work"},{"c":1,"t":"things out for himself.","w":0.17508069356282552,"y":0.10210343793600951,"x":0.16295284117444103,"h":0.016070172794140025},{"c":1,"t":"Mmm. You could see him trying out different things rather than asking the teacher","x":0.16493028008024122,"h":0.018950191985038223,"y":0.11553871986286457,"w":0.64489705403645825},{"x":0.16485425756499855,"w":0.3110792032877604,"y":0.1330789744719808,"h":0.017982031326056247,"c":1,"t":"for help. What did you make of Naomi?"},{"x":0.16490606364416655,"h":0.019854295439437841,"c":1,"t":"She seemed to be losing interest at one point but then she decided she wanted","y":0.14728234652837835,"w":0.62749435424804689},{"t":"her mouse to be the best and that motivated her to try harder.","c":1,"y":0.16536885583783723,"w":0.487540028889974,"x":0.16495723686367086,"h":0.016538992551999643},{"c":1,"y":0.18161993764546136,"x":0.16504854331596011,"w":0.43106796264648439,"t":"She didn't seem satisfied with hers in the end, though.","h":0.016199376947040545},{"c":1,"x":0.16491482089062817,"t":"Anya was such a star. She listened so carefully and then produced the perfect","w":0.62163909912109383,"h":0.020418099376642851,"y":0.21192886781585318},{"y":0.2311046513456706,"t":"bird with very little effort.","c":1,"w":0.19611649831136069,"h":0.014689741402028944,"x":0.16504854798024193},{"c":1,"t":"Mmm - I think the teacher could have increased the level of difficulty for her.","y":0.24523651270625635,"x":0.16497963987164696,"h":0.016521957136017451,"w":0.60399714152018225},{"w":0.51857172648111982,"c":1,"y":0.26143877536295701,"h":0.017853987031265284,"t":"Maybe. I think it was the first time Zara had come across origami.","x":0.16497704366491206},{"w":0.44660191853841147,"y":0.27906976753291945,"h":0.015988371899566145,"t":"She looked as if she didn't really get what was going on.","x":0.16699030279372895,"c":1},{"w":0.60799901326497396,"h":0.018508158888772219,"x":0.16687076168510137,"c":1,"t":"She seemed unsure about what she was supposed to do, but in the end hers","y":0.29341628858026214},{"t":"didn't turn out too badly.","x":0.16699029174464552,"y":0.31246105944861369,"w":0.19223300933837889,"h":0.014641744548286595,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.32614000409645261,"w":0.47020050048828133,"t":"Yeah. I'm sure it was a positive learning experience for her.","x":0.16682183097576134,"h":0.01941264262451925},{"c":1,"y":0.34447674434470166,"t":"Mmm.","h":0.014534883112922281,"x":0.16504854341195452,"w":0.056310679117838575},{"t":"I think one reason why the origami activity worked so well in this class was that","h":0.020075660776869175,"w":0.6274742126464844,"x":0.1668444243652695,"y":0.38015385152280556,"c":1},{"w":0.24854370117187499,"t":"the teacher was well prepared.","y":0.39968847329645685,"h":0.014641744548286595,"x":0.16699028540700159,"c":1},{"w":0.61772008260091149,"h":0.018427263539156802,"c":1,"t":"Right. I think it would have taken me ages to prepare examples, showing each","y":0.41339801573228263,"x":0.16881991993412118},{"x":0.16686658338086885,"y":0.42940384318328273,"t":"of the steps involved in making the bird. But that was a really good idea. The","c":1,"h":0.018259043114207563,"w":0.60606389363606783},{"t":"children could see what they were aiming for - and much better for them to be","y":0.44532201125456383,"w":0.61775070190429693,"x":0.16878481436665443,"h":0.018968832901333665,"c":1},{"x":0.16874822810890341,"w":0.46631693522135409,"t":"able to hold something, rather than just looking at pictures.","y":0.46159168768688719,"h":0.019559017668631995,"c":1},{"y":0.47710488247275151,"h":0.019473444264254569,"x":0.16877850673713529,"t":"Mmm - those physical examples supported her verbal explanations really well.","w":0.62355468749999998,"c":1},{"w":0.57505518595377603,"h":0.019120502174828968,"y":0.49411980357084184,"c":1,"t":"It's strange that origami isn't used more widely. Why do you think that is?","x":0.1688014003169104},{"c":1,"t":"Well, teachers may just feel it's not that appealing to children who are used to","h":0.019785252984067747,"x":0.16878562970053831,"y":0.50962780607327274,"w":0.61196121215820309},{"x":0.16871227845981329,"w":0.60238571166992183,"h":0.023530733102578583,"c":1,"t":"doing everything on computers, especially boys. Even if they're aware of the","y":0.52396867116388635},{"h":0.016684303402529244,"w":0.073167451222737656,"y":0.5438081062888821,"c":1,"t":"benefits.","x":0.16840663709036419},{"y":0.55820595758646085,"w":0.621617431640625,"c":1,"x":0.16880726810215863,"h":0.01947597491778319,"t":"Oh, I don't know. It's no different to any other craft activity. Ibet it's because so"},{"w":0.27766990661621094,"x":0.16893203890063233,"h":0.014641744548286595,"t":"many teachers are clumsy like me.","c":1,"y":0.57694704063457869},{"t":"That's true - too much effort required if you're not good with your hands.","w":0.57491933186848954,"h":0.018068128211476076,"c":1,"y":0.59130893152844466,"x":0.16883399528242193},{"y":0.60718433625192758,"w":0.59826100667317705,"c":1,"h":0.018435263708001637,"t":"Well, anyway, Ithink we should try it out in our maths teaching practice with","x":0.16883186287446544},{"t":"Year 3. I can see using origami is a really engaging way of reinforcing children's","x":0.1687649554758921,"h":0.020718453903435963,"y":0.62196845056309635,"c":1,"w":0.6313850911458333},{"h":0.020832589407947633,"c":1,"t":"knowledge of geometric shapes, like they were doing in the video, but I think it","w":0.6236264038085938,"y":0.63855201434895004,"x":0.16682736100597254},{"y":0.6558455403965302,"c":1,"w":0.60987579345703125,"x":0.16883649397034503,"t":"would also work really well for presenting fractions, which is coming up soon.","h":0.017826615092910392},{"y":0.67140216512734185,"c":1,"w":0.62154103597005217,"t":"Good idea - that's something most of the kids in that class might struggle with.","h":0.018693841952029833,"x":0.17077501571850309},{"w":0.60991816202799476,"c":1,"t":"Origami would also be good practice for using symmetry - but I think they did","y":0.68794127342007572,"h":0.018609646473346841,"x":0.17078299800023142},{"c":1,"w":0.11513455708821613,"t":"that last term.","y":0.70723466286370817,"h":0.013863218313436954,"x":0.16867071903620712},{"c":1,"t":"OK - well let's try and get some ideas together and plan the lesson next week.","x":0.17271941370838279,"w":0.61960601806640625,"y":0.72003337320853489,"h":0.017441172614647171},{"c":1,"x":0.17087379071590003,"w":0.21359222412109374,"t":"OK, if you coula all stop ...","y":0.7398255814816953,"h":0.015988371899566145},{"w":0.1029126230875651,"y":0.79215116287143783,"h":0.015988371899566145,"t":"PART 4","c":1,"x":0.075728154380489299},{"c":1,"x":0.077564744578029379,"w":0.70700439453124997,"t":"The person l've chosen to talk about is the French writer Victor Hugo - many people have","y":0.81786999363031598,"h":0.018107730354475438},{"w":0.71863057454427093,"h":0.019270469689294911,"x":0.073716858391031981,"c":1,"y":0.83498916178236682,"t":"heard of him because his novel, Les Misérables, which he wrote in 1862, is famous around"},{"t":"the world. It became a stage musical in the 1980s, and a film version was also released in","y":0.84984059709688908,"x":0.075598359815276503,"w":0.70901204427083331,"h":0.020885557846116898,"c":1},{"h":0.019952118062527391,"c":1,"x":0.075611550755053158,"y":0.86707693685447795,"w":0.73809494018554678,"t":"2012. So, some of us, I'm sure, have a pretty general idea of the plot, but we know much less"},{"w":0.71490681966145841,"h":0.021378770869840302,"x":0.075575910934240459,"c":1,"t":"about the author. Today, I'm going to provide a little more insight into this talented man and","y":0.88258826378449984},{"c":1,"h":0.018270547813344251,"x":0.077560523281490254,"y":0.89944412540187135,"t":"I'm going to talk particularly about the home he had on the island of Guernsey in the British","w":0.71479965209960938},{"w":0.13847319285074869,"y":0.91835895528712719,"c":1,"t":"Channel Islands.","h":0.016370623579649246,"x":0.075443293329061495},{"t":"Test 4","h":0.014862080749321605,"c":1,"y":0.033266634018501162,"x":0.84070877358663243,"w":0.062271773020426524},{"t":"Q24","w":0.036893202463785912,"x":0.83300970935063134,"h":0.013081395514657479,"c":1,"y":0.11482558127396403},{"c":1,"x":0.83300970941859254,"w":0.036893202463785912,"h":0.014534883112922281,"t":"Q25","y":0.1468023258127249},{"t":"Q26","y":0.21220930220419654,"h":0.01308139551465759,"x":0.83300970935063134,"c":1,"w":0.036893202463785912},{"y":0.29360465104354327,"c":1,"x":0.83300970935602514,"w":0.036893202463785801,"t":"Q27","h":0.01308139551465759},{"y":0.41279069755517117,"w":0.036893202463785801,"c":1,"h":0.01308139551465759,"t":"Q28","x":0.83495145692884065},{"w":0.036893202463785801,"h":0.01308139551465759,"t":"Q29","c":1,"x":0.83495145693486883,"y":0.55813953476233602},{"h":0.014534883112922281,"c":1,"t":"Q30","x":0.83689320444771886,"y":0.60610465139412029,"w":0.036893202463785801},{"w":0.036893202463785801,"c":1,"h":0.014534883112922281,"x":0.8718446610253886,"t":"117","y":0.94912790709906214}],"w":2400,"h":3209}